        "column_rPeXhL": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Glyphosate",
            "text": "<h4></h4><h4><strong>Not Detected</strong></h4><h6>Every production run is independently tested by a third-party laboratory for glyphosate and related herbicides. We test for <strong>glyphosate, AMPA, and glufosinate</strong>, using advanced <strong>LC-MS/MS analytical methods</strong>.</h6><h6></h6><h6><strong>Result:</strong><br/>Glyphosate — <strong>Not Detected</strong><br/>AMPA — <strong>Not Detected</strong><br/>Glufosinate — <strong>Not Detected</strong></h6><h6>MDL for all testing is 0.01 mg/kg</h6><h6></h6><h6>This means that none of these compounds were detectable at the laboratory’s sensitivity threshold.</h6><h6>We make these reports publicly available so customers can see the data for themselves.</h6>",
            "link_label": "Download",
            "link": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0814/9601/5123/files/SimpleLab_Report_FMY67B.pdf?v=1772901079"
          }
        },
        "column_D9N6bP": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Kosher",
            "text": "<h6>Boostcous is produced in accordance with kosher standards and is certified by The Kashruth Council of Canada (COR).</h6><h6>This certification verifies that our ingredients, production processes, and facility practices meet the requirements of kosher dietary laws.</h6><h6>Kosher certification is reviewed and maintained through ongoing oversight and compliance checks.</h6><h6>For full documentation and verification, you can download our current certificate below.</h6>",
            "link_label": "Download",
            "link": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0814/9601/5123/files/LOC_Kosher_Cert_05_Jan_2026_15-50-38.pdf?v=1773001337"
          }
        },
        "column_RxTLLe": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Gluten Free",
            "text": "<h6>Boostcous is made entirely from naturally gluten-free ingredients including chickpea, lentil, and pea flour.</h6><h6>Our raw materials and manufacturing facility is gluten-free certified and our finished products are certified through the <strong>Gluten-Free Certification Organization (GFCO)</strong>.</h6><h6>We have completed the certification process and are currently awaiting final approval and documentation. Once issued, our official gluten-free certification will be posted here.</h6>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_m34nJm": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Non-GMO Certified Ingredients",
            "text": "<h6>Boostcous is made from three simple ingredients: chickpeas, yellow lentils, and yellow peas. All of these pulses are sourced from suppliers that provide <strong>Non-GMO Project certification and full traceability documentation</strong>.</h6><h6>Our ingredient partners verify that these crops are <strong>grown, handled, and processed without genetic modification</strong>, ensuring the integrity of our supply chain from farm to finished product.</h6><h6>We believe simple food should stay simple — real ingredients, responsibly sourced, and an ingredient label that you can recognize tot he everyday eater.</h6>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
